docs/superpowers/evidence/tsk-808/a3-terminal-receipt.md:5:A3-terminal is implemented on branch `tsk-808-assembly-wave` from base commit `d68c238`. The legacy monolithic transcript reader is split by provider, and terminal-backed conversations can now register one Rust-owned incremental transcript watcher that continues emitting canonical `AgentEvent` records whether its session is visible or hidden. No frontend polling code was changed in this lane; the exact controller patch is included below.
