docs/superpowers/evidence/tsk-808/a6-workflow-engine-receipt.md-7-Stop result: no stop condition was triggered. There is one ledger, one JSONL path, no prose/regex gate authority, no direct child process path, and stale multi-writer transitions are rejected by expected-sequence comparison under the shared ledger writer lock.
