docs/superpowers/evidence/tsk-808/a7-control-center-receipt.md:12:A7 is implemented as a frontend-only Agent Control Center. The UI consumes complete `WorkflowRunRecord` snapshots, keeps only selection/filter state locally, sends every control through `workflowService.ts`, preserves the engine's typed loop phase, and keeps `workflowRunId` separate from provider-owned `ownedId`.
