     1	/**
     2	 * Owned-session identity and lifecycle records for the /next shell.
     3	 *
     4	 * ownedId (CommandBar-minted) is the PRIMARY key across rail, manager,
     5	 * persistence, and active-tracking. Provider ids are mutable (a resume mints a
     6	 * new one), so they are carried but never used as keys.
     7	 */
