    17	
    18	## Owned files and symbols
    19	
    20	### Typed workflow contracts — `src/lib/shell/workflows/workflowTypes.ts`
    21	
    22	- Exact serialized engine records: `WorkflowRunRecord`, `WorkflowNodeRunRecord`, `WorkflowGateRecord`, `WorkflowArtifactRef`, `WorkflowFailure`.
    23	- Exact serialized definitions and policies: `WorkflowDefinitionV1`, `AgentRoleDefinition`, `WorkflowNodeDefinition`, `WorkflowEdge`, provider/model/effort/permission/workspace/retry/budget/concurrency/completion policies.
